                    </div>
                    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-135b6ccd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor"
                        data-id="135b6ccd" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
                        style="text-align:justify;">
                        <div class="elementor-widget-container">
                            <p>We are world-class manufacturers and exporters of gear pumps. We are well known for our
                                reliable service and international standard products. Gear pumps are widely used in
                                chemical plants and other locations where viscous and semi-viscous liquids are utilized.
                                These pumps are in high demand due to their tough, seamless finishing, good suction
                                quality and high delivery capacity. We provide superior quality rotary gear pumps with
                                unique features and designs at competitive market prices.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <section
                        class="elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-7f7c30d1 dsvy-col-stretched-none dsvy-bg-color-over-image elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default"
